# YouTube Data API v3 key — enables live mode.
# Without it, YouPlus runs on curated mock data.
#
# Get a key:
#   1. https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials
#   2. Enable the YouTube Data API v3 in your project
#   3. Create an API key (no OAuth needed — read-only public endpoints)
#   4. Restrict the key to YouTube Data API v3 (and optionally to localhost
#      + your production domain).
#
# Free quota: 10,000 units / day.
# YouPlus aggressively caches (Next.js ISR + in-memory 5-min) — usage stays
# well under 1,000 units/day for a small site.
#
# YOUTUBE_API_KEY=AIzaSy...
